<a href="http://gangrey.com/1326">
<h2 class="design">Two Lives Blurred</h2></a>
<h4 class="byline">'the last of 11 that I sent that day'</h4>

<p>

Read <a href="http://www.latimes.com/news/nationworld/nation/la-na-marlboro11nov11,1,7648591,full.story?coll=la-headlines-nation&ctrack=1&cset=true">this</a>, watch <a href="http://www.latimes.com/news/nationworld/nation/marlboromarine/">this</a>, like right now: "I have to ask you something, Blake," I said. "If I'd gone down in Fallouja, would you have carried me out?"<br />
<br />
"Damn straight," he said, without hesitation.<br />
<br />
"OK then," I said. "I think you're wounded pretty badly. I want to help you."<br />
<br />
He looked at me for a moment. "All right," he said.
